0.1531.257It is described in paragraph 125 of the specification with reference to Figure 4 that "[t]he microphone M3 detects sounds that are emitted from the real-world environment in which the user 7 is located. For example, as the user 7 stands up from the seat 402A or sits down on the seat 402A, a noise is created and the noise is detected by the microphone M3 to capture an audio data set p, where p is an integer". As such, the specification provides an example illustrating that the set of audio data of claim 1 is captured by a microphone.

